      "text": "Cook, stirring continuously, until the mixture thickens, about 5 minutes.",
      "timer_minutes": 5
    },
    {
      "step": 4,
      "text": "Remove from the heat and stir in the vanilla extract. Let the sauce cool for 5 minutes before serving.",
